  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power of Voices - Benkadi Transnational</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Benkadi is a civil society initiative that aims to improve the effectiveness of public policies for climate
change adaption and mitigation of climate change effects in West Africa through more inclusive
governance. Benkadi is a consortium with a structure that supports southern leadership, in which the
South has taken initiative and ownership and ensures end-user representation in the decision-making
processes related to climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
